OL,3,GNEWSADry slopes could return to former
OL,4,ASki Village site
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew images have been released of an
OL,7,Fadventure park planned as part of the
OL,8,Fredevelopment of the former Sheffield
OL,9,FSki Village site.
OL,11,FNew Zealand-based Skylines Enterprises
OL,12,Fhave partnered with the city council to
OL,13,Fturn Parkwood Springs into a
OL,14,Fdestination for activities such as
OL,15,Fdownhill karting and zip line.
OL,17,FThe company has also said it may
OL,18,Fconsider reintroducing the dry ski
OL,19,Fslopes that were once part of the
OL,20,Fcomplex.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
