OL,3,GNEWSADry slopes could return to former
OL,4,ASki Village site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of a consultation on the plans
OL,7,Fthat is running until 20 September,
OL,8,FSkyline chief executive Geoff McDonald
OL,9,Fsaid: "We believe the Parkwood Springs
OL,10,Fproject has the potential to become one
OL,11,Fof the UK's most distinctive outdoor
OL,12,Fleisure destinations."
